31976L0207: Directive 76/207/EEC, amended by Directive 2002/73/EC, whose only date in Cellar is
its entry into force (EV, 5 October 2002, Article 3), with no date of transposition. Recorded
2026-11-22 with the queries above, celex 31976L0207: act-, versions-, languages-, dates-,
titles-, amendments- and publications-31976L0207.json. 2 consolidations, of 5 October 2002 and
15 August 2006.

32004R0917: Regulation (EC) No 917/2004, amended by Regulation (EC) No 1484/2004, whose day of
application Cellar does not give: an MA date of 1001-01-01, set from the start of the 2004/2005
marketing year (DEB/CAMP), with no article. Recorded 2026-11-22 in the same way: act-, versions-,
languages-, dates-, titles-, amendments- and publications-32004R0917.json. 8 consolidations.

32013L0036: Directive 2013/36/EU, amended by Directive (EU) 2024/1619. Cellar lists 2024/1619 in
the consolidation of 29 July 2024 and no act in the consolidation of 11 January 2026. 2024/1619
has a date of transposition with the type APPLICATION on 11 January 2026. Recorded 2026-11-22
with the queries above, celex 32013L0036: act-, versions-, languages-, dates-, titles-,
amendments- and publications-32013L0036.json. Its texts of 17 January 2025 and of 11 January
2026 are converter samples (libs/formex-converter fixtures 06.02.1/02013L0036-20250117 and
06.02.4/02013L0036-20260111). The text of 2026 tags Article 3(1), point (9a), as inserted by
2024/1619; the text of 2025 does not have that point.

32008R0767: Regulation (EC) No 767/2008 (the Visa Information System), amended by Regulation (EU)
2017/2226. Cellar does not list 2017/2226 in the consolidation of 29 December 2017, but its text
tags 16 occurrences with it. 2017/2226 enters into force on 29 December 2017, Article 73 applies
part of it from that day, and the whole act applies from 12 October 2025, a day that Decision (EU)
2025/1544 sets. Recorded 2026-11-23 with the queries above, celex 32008R0767: act-, versions-,
languages-, dates-, titles-, amendments- and publications-32008R0767.json. 10 consolidations.
Five of its English texts are converter samples (libs/formex-converter fixtures
04.00/32008R0767, 05.10/02008R0767-20100405, 05.22/02008R0767-20131018,
05.56/02008R0767-20171229 and 06.02.1/02008R0767-20251012): a divergence needs the texts of the
versions before the one that first tags a change, and the text of the version that starts on the
day the change applies.

32018R1862: Regulation (EU) 2018/1862 (the Schengen Information System in police and judicial
cooperation). It applies from 7 March 2023, a date whose comment names Decision (EU) 2023/201, and
has dates for parts from 28 December 2019. It is amended by 2021/1133, which applies from a date
that its Article 6 sets (an MA date of 1001-01-01), and by 2022/1190. Cellar gives 1 August 2022
for the change of 2022/1190 at Article 79(7), and 15 October 2026 for its other 18 changes. Recorded 2026-11-23 with
the queries above, celex 32018R1862: act-, versions-, languages-, dates-, titles-, amendments- and
publications-32018R1862.json.

32016R0679: Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (the General Data Protection Regulation). It enters into force
on 24 May 2016 and applies from 25 May 2018, by its Article 99. Cellar lists no amendment of it.
Recorded 2026-11-23 with the queries above, celex 32016R0679: act-, versions-, languages-, dates-,
titles-, amendments- and publications-32016R0679.json.

