The amendments-*.json of every act above were recorded again on 2026-11-24, with amendments.rq
as it then was: each row also has the labels, the English words of each fd_370 code of its
location, as EUR-Lex shows them. The rows are the same as before.

subdivisions-fd_370.json: Cellar's table of subdivisions, fd_370, with the English words of each
code (skos:prefLabel), as EUR-Lex shows them in "Subdivision concerned". Recorded 2026-11-24 with
the query: SELECT ?code ?label WHERE { ?code skos:inScheme <…/authority/fd_370> ; skos:prefLabel
?label . FILTER(LANG(?label) = "en") } ORDER BY ?code. 33 codes. The rules use it to read the
places of their steps back into Cellar's codes.

